== Walkthrough ==

''[[Noxhil V`Sek]] may be found at the top of the necromancers guild (1304, -1248).''

You say, 'Hail, Noxhil V`Sek' 

: Noxhil V`Sek says, 'Greetings, ______! We of the Dead are proud to have you among us. Your lineage is well known. Still, you must learn to claw your way to the upper echelon. There are many [menial tasks] to be performed before you can truly be inducted as a member.' 

You say, 'What menial tasks?' 

: Noxhil V`Sek says, 'You cannot avoid the toll of peons. We have all spent our time in the lower ranks. There are duties such as [collecting fire beetle eyes].' 

You say, 'Collecting fire beetle eyes?' 

'''At apprehensive faction:'''

: Noxhil V`Sek says, 'How dare you enter my presence?! In the name of the Dead I should strike you down!'

'''At amiable or better faction:'''

: Noxhil V`Sek says, 'Take this chest. It has been fitted with a mold designed to hold ten beetle eyes. We require them for further experiments. Do not return until you fill the chest.' 

''You receive an [[Fire Beetle Eye Box|Empty Box]].''

'''Combine 10 x [[Fire Beetle Eye]]s in the crate to craft a [[Box of Beetle Eyes]]. '''

You have fashioned the items together to create something new! 

'''Hand in the [[Box of Beetle Eyes]] to [[Noxhil V`Sek]].'''

: Noxhil V`Sek says, 'Fantastic work, my child! We shall store these for further experiments. Take this as extra payment for a fine job. You have done so well I believe you can assist in obtaining two [other components].'

